      "writtenOn": "2022-10-06T17:58:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u0027fan speed\u0027 is applicable only if the fan is controlled linearly (in proportion to the temp ratio). For non-linear fan controls (e.g. custom), it\u0027s not fan speed at all. \n\nSo (as I mentioned) we can fix this only by adding a new command which returns actual fan speeds. A workaround is describing it correctly in this help text.\n\n    \u0027temperature ratio between fan_off and fan_max values,\n     which could be a fan speed if it\u0027s controlled linearly.\u0027",
